# Enforce LF for byte-sensitive JSON: tests assert LF bytes
# (test_file_formatting_lf_two_space_indent) and the preliminary
# adapter hashes exact source bytes for provenance. CRLF checkout on
# Windows (core.autocrlf=true) breaks those assertions. Scoped to the
# affected directories only; all other paths keep default behavior.
fixtures/synthetic/*.json text eol=lf
experiments/003_video_to_recipe/annotations/preliminary/*.json text eol=lf
tests/data/canonical/*.json text eol=lf
